    <item>
      <title>QEC Charter</title>
      <link>http://localhost:1313/2026/charter/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <guid>http://localhost:1313/2026/charter/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h2 id=&#34;goal-of-the-conference&#34;&gt;Goal of the conference&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;QEC is a conference on Quantum Error Correction and includes both theoretical and experimental research and advances.  The conference is held every year or every other year at the discretion of the steering committee. Its goal is to represent the best research in the area, in the form of both invited and contributed talks.&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;format-of-the-conference&#34;&gt;Format of the conference&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;The conference features both invited and contributed talks, with the steering committee selecting the invited talks and a program committee selecting contributed talks. The conference has no published proceedings.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
    </item>
